comments.body:
For me, the question goes hand in hand with our release process. Can we define in advance when we want to make a cut-out? Like for example at https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/main/RELEASE.md ? What do you think about every 4 months? a) February 25, b) June 25, c) October 25

As we currently have an irregular release schedule for onnx, do we not need to follow the release process of other projects?  Or would other times make more sense?

@participant1
